{% decision_card number="ADR-0010" status="approved" %}
One decision. Status reviewed 2026-07-27.
{% /decision_card %}

## Context

Confident review cannot prove that code builds, tests pass, or security checks succeed.

## Decision drivers

- Reproducibility
- Blocking failures
- Acceptance evidence

## Options considered

- Model-only approval
- Optional commands
- Mandatory applicable commands before voting

## Decision

Run real applicable repository commands before review convergence. A failed blocking gate cannot be outvoted.

## Positive consequences

- Objective completion evidence
- Prevents confidence-based overrides

## Negative consequences

- Commands require maintenance and can be slow

## Risks

- A narrow suite can still miss behavior

## Follow-up work

- Add tests with each behavior
- Record command and environment

## Supersedes or superseded by

New decision; superseded by: none.

